  "description": "Artefact-by-artefact method and tooling for a Windows examination: the file system and its journals, the hives, execution evidence, the event logs and the records inside a cleared one, accounts and remote access, persistence, PowerShell, browsers, shadow copies, memory, and the traces anti-forensics leaves.",
